Introduction

The SkillsTrack Learner Support Portal will use Firebase Realtime Database to store application data.
The database structure has been planned before development to ensure data is organised, scalable and easy to access using REST API calls.
The main collections will be Users, Tasks, Support Bookings, Game Scores and Learning Resources.

